# game/story/chapter4.rpy:22
translate indonesian chapter4_start_6cde7925:

    # narrator "Above Fort Bastion, the sky has torn open into a cathedral of swirling violet ash and blinding gold rings. Every breath tastes of static and cold pennies."
    narrator "Di atas Benteng Bastion, langit telah terkoyak menjadi katedral abu violet yang berputar dan lingkaran emas yang menyilaukan. Setiap tarikan napas terasa bak sengatan statis dan koin logam dingin."

# game/story/chapter4.rpy:28
translate indonesian chapter4_start_d285da1e:

    # vespera "Look at the outer Causeway—Cassian's engineers opened the Crucible vents! And Seraphina broke off from our rear guard ten minutes ago to beat us to the altar!"
    vespera "Lihat Jembatan luar itu—para insinyur Cassian membuka katup-katup Kawah! Dan Seraphina memisahkan diri dari barisan belakang kita sepuluh menit lalu untuk mendahului kita ke altar!"

# game/story/chapter4.rpy:29
translate indonesian chapter4_start_14e242e9:

    # bram "Hold up! Look down the ridge toward Thornwick—are those torches?!"
    bram "Tunggu dulu! Lihat ke bawah punggung bukit ke arah Thornwick—apakah itu obor?!"

# game/story/chapter4.rpy:32
translate indonesian chapter4_start_b0d2ddcc:

    # narrator "Winding up the switchback road behind us march Mistress Halda, Clerk Fen, Master Orin, and forty frontier masons hauling coils of heavy copper drainage cable on their shoulders!"
    narrator "Berbaris mendaki jalan berkelok di belakang kami, tampak Nyonya Halda, Juru Tulis Fen, Tetua Orin, dan empat puluh tukang batu perbatasan yang memanggul gulungan kabel tembaga drainase berat di pundak mereka!"

# game/story/chapter4.rpy:35
translate indonesian chapter4_start_979be657:

    # orin "Did you think Thornwick would let four youngsters shovel its ash alone, Master Leo?! Keep climbing—we're stringing a municipal grounding grid right up the mountain!"
    orin "Apakah kalian pikir Thornwick akan membiarkan empat anak muda menyekop abunya sendirian, Tuan Muda Leo?! Teruslah mendaki—kami sedang membentangkan jaringan pembumian kota langsung ke puncak gunung!"

# game/story/chapter4.rpy:40
translate indonesian chapter4_start_aecc4433:

    # narrator "Master Orin catches up to us at the gatehouse, pressing coils of copper grounding wire into Bram's hands."
    narrator "Tetua Orin menyusul kami di pos gerbang, menyerahkan gulungan kawat pembumian tembaga ke tangan Bram."

# game/story/chapter4.rpy:41
translate indonesian chapter4_start_b4aa4a31:

    # orin "I've wired the Conservatory's deep cisterns to the lower conduit! Get that Calibration Plate to the summit—and watch your minds inside the Hollow mist!"
    orin "Aku sudah menyambungkan tangki bawah tanah Konservatori yang dalam ke saluran bawah! Bawa Pelat Kalibrasi itu ke puncak—dan jaga pikiran kalian di dalam kabut Hampa!"

# game/story/chapter4.rpy:51
translate indonesian chapter4_start_5071cf7d:

    # narrator "One step across the Spire's inner ward, Solvara vanishes."
    narrator "Satu langkah melintasi pelataran dalam Menara, Solvara lenyap."

# game/story/chapter4.rpy:52
translate indonesian chapter4_start_d98a510d:

    # narrator "Cold October rain soaks through my knees. Rust. Wet aluminum bleachers. The torn mustard-yellow page of {i}Sir Valorian{/i} floats in a muddy puddle two inches from my face."
    narrator "Hujan dingin bulan Oktober meresap menembus lutut celanaku. Karat. Tribun aluminium yang basah. Halaman kuning mustard robek dari {i}Sir Valorian{/i} mengambang di genangan lumpur hanya dua inci dari wajahku."

# game/story/chapter4.rpy:58
translate indonesian chapter4_start_02b7435b:

    # marcus "Seriously, Sato? Twenty-six years old and you {i}still{/i} carry that pathetic notebook around?"
    marcus "Serius, Sato? Umur dua puluh enam tahun dan kau {i}masih{/i} menenteng buku catatan menyedihkan itu ke mana-mana?"

# game/story/chapter4.rpy:60
translate indonesian chapter4_start_4f6316ef:

    # narrator "A figure coalesces out of grey rain and salt-static—wearing Marcus's sixth-grade letter jacket, speaking in a voice braided from every manager, landlord, and late-night intrusive thought I've ever had."
    narrator "Sosok mewujud dari hujan kelabu dan statis garam—mengenakan jaket tim kelas enam Marcus, berbicara dengan suara yang dipilin dari setiap manajer, pemilik kontrakan, dan pikiran buruk larut malam yang pernah kualami."

# game/story/chapter4.rpy:61
translate indonesian chapter4_start_0c21fbcf:

    # marcus "Look at you. Couldn't make friends, couldn't ask for chopsticks, couldn't build a real life—so you prayed for a magic world where strangers have to care about you!"
    marcus "Lihat dirimu. Tak bisa cari teman, tak berani minta sumpit, tak bisa membangun hidup yang nyata—jadi kau berdoa meminta dunia sihir di mana orang asing terpaksa peduli padamu!"

# game/story/chapter4.rpy:64
translate indonesian chapter4_start_f76b93ca:

    # marcus "Remember what you swore in the mud? 'Someday I'll be strong enough that nobody laughs!' Well, the Crucible's right upstairs! Drink the fire! Show everybody!"
    marcus "Ingat apa yang kau sumpahkan di dalam lumpur? 'Suatu hari nanti aku akan cukup kuat sampai tak ada yang berani menertawakanku!' Nah, Kawah persis di lantai atas! Minum apinya! Tunjukkan pada semua orang!"

# game/story/chapter4.rpy:66
translate indonesian chapter4_start_84d10bb4:

    # marcus "Still counting footsteps and looking for the back exit, coward? Keep running home the long way!"
    marcus "Masih menghitung langkah kaki dan mencari pintu belakang, pengecut? Teruslah lari pulang lewat jalan memutar!"

# game/story/chapter4.rpy:68
translate indonesian chapter4_start_43d5e248:

    # marcus "Still moving earthworms out of puddles so you can pretend being weak is the same thing as being kind?"
    marcus "Masih memindahkan cacing tanah dari genangan air agar kau bisa berpura-pura bahwa menjadi lemah itu sama dengan berhati baik?"

# game/story/chapter4.rpy:70
translate indonesian chapter4_start_885cf652:

    # narrator "My chest constricts. That awful, familiar heat stings behind my nose—twenty-six years old, and a hallucination of sixth grade still makes my hands shake."
    narrator "Dadaku sesak. Rasa panas yang mengerikan dan familier itu menyengat di balik hidungku—umur dua puluh enam tahun, dan halusinasi kelas enam SD masih membuat kedua tanganku gemetar."

# game/story/chapter4.rpy:71
translate indonesian chapter4_start_cc02d802:

    # thought "Wait. Look at my hands. Yes, they're shaking. They shook at the Aqueduct too. They shook in the Archive."
    thought "Tunggu. Lihat kedua tanganku. Ya, tanganku gemetar. Tanganku gemetar di Akuaduk juga. Tanganku gemetar di Arsip."

# game/story/chapter4.rpy:80
translate indonesian chapter4_start_1c4d8a94:

    # leo "You're right about one thing: I spent way too many years waiting for a fantasy story to fix my life."
    leo "Kau benar tentang satu hal: aku menghabiskan terlalu banyak tahun menunggu kisah fantasi memperbaiki hidupku."

# game/story/chapter4.rpy:81
translate indonesian chapter4_start_49092de9:

    # leo "That nine-year-old kid in the mud wasn't pathetic for wanting someone to save him. He was just lonely. And he doesn't live under these bleachers anymore."
    leo "Bocah sembilan tahun di dalam lumpur itu tidak menyedihkan hanya karena ingin seseorang menyelamatkannya. Dia hanya kesepian. Dan dia tidak tinggal di kolong tribun ini lagi."

# game/story/chapter4.rpy:82
translate indonesian chapter4_start_55da588d:

    # narrator "I fold the wet paper carefully, slip it into my pocket beside my brass laundry token, and walk straight through the rain-shadow."
    narrator "Kulipat kertas basah itu hati-hati, menyelipkannya ke dalam saku di samping koin binatu kuninganku, dan melangkah lurus menembus bayang-bayang hujan."

# game/story/chapter4.rpy:90
translate indonesian chapter4_start_db12aa3c:

    # leo "SHUT UP!"
    leo "DIAM KAU!"

# game/story/chapter4.rpy:91
translate indonesian chapter4_start_8c78e819:

    # narrator "Blinding violet fire erupts from my fist, vaporizing bleachers, rain, fence, and Marcus alike! No shaking. No fear. Only cold, weightless silence where fourth grade used to be."
    narrator "Api violet yang menyilaukan meledak dari kepalan tanganku, menguapkan tribun, hujan, pagar kawat, dan Marcus sekaligus! Tak ada gemetar. Tak ada rasa takut. Hanya keheningan dingin tanpa beban di tempat kelas empat SD dulu pernah ada."

# game/story/chapter4.rpy:96
translate indonesian chapter4_start_d4387908:

    # leo "Vespera and Bram are waiting upstairs. Talk all you want—I'm walking."
    leo "Vespera dan Bram menunggu di atas. Bicaralah sesukamu—aku terus melangkah."

# game/story/chapter4.rpy:110
translate indonesian chapter4_start_2a094f61:

    # narrator "We burst onto the summit ring just as the Crucible's central column roars skyward—a thirty-foot cylinder of hungry white-gold light!"
    narrator "Kami menerobos masuk ke lingkar puncak tepat saat pilar tengah Kawah menggelegar ke angkasa—silinder cahaya putih-keemasan yang lapar setinggi sepuluh meter!"

# game/story/chapter4.rpy:111
translate indonesian chapter4_start_a1a8338a:

    # narrator "High Marshal Cassian stands with bare steel lowered in salute; three paces ahead of him, Seraphina stands on the lip of the dais, her cobalt coat already dissolving into motes of silver ash at the hem."
    narrator "Marsekal Tinggi Cassian berdiri dengan pedang terhunus tertunduk memberi hormat; tiga langkah di depannya, Seraphina berdiri di tepi altar panggung, mantel kobalt birunya sudah mulai luruh menjadi bintik-bintik abu perak di bagian ujungnya."

# game/story/chapter4.rpy:113
translate indonesian chapter4_start_28145bf7:

    # cassian "Step back, Broker Kael! The northern cliff just dropped into the sea—if the Crucible isn't fed an anchor within two minutes, Bastion falls!"
    cassian "Mundur, Pialang Kael! Tebing utara baru saja runtuh ke laut—jika Kawah tidak diberi makan jangkar dalam dua menit, Bastion akan hancur!"

# game/story/chapter4.rpy:114
translate indonesian chapter4_start_ad5ae442:

    # sera "Stay back, Sato! Don't ruin the one thing I'm actually good for!"
    sera "Jangan mendekat, Sato! Jangan hancurkan satu-satunya hal yang bisa kulakukan dengan benar!"

# game/story/chapter4.rpy:115
translate indonesian chapter4_start_494c9cf5:

    # narrator "Tears spill down Seraphina's cheeks, evaporating into white salt before they reach her chin."
    narrator "Air mata tumpah di pipi Seraphina, menguap menjadi garam putih bahkan sebelum menyentuh dagunya."

# game/story/chapter4.rpy:116
translate indonesian chapter4_start_5185cccd:

    # sera "I can't remember my mom's first name anymore! If I go back to Earth like this, who am I?! At least if I burn here, thirty thousand people live and {i}somebody{/i} remembers Seraphina!"
    sera "Aku tak bisa mengingat nama depan ibuku lagi! Jika aku pulang ke Bumi seperti ini, siapa diriku?! Setidaknya jika aku terbakar di sini, tiga puluh ribu orang selamat dan {i}seseorang{/i} akan mengingat Seraphina!"

# game/story/chapter4.rpy:124
translate indonesian chapter4_start_b01fa22c:

    # leo "Your mom's waiting in a kitchen that smells like lemon and ginger, Sera! And Vespera dragged a three-hundred-pound bronze plate up six hundred stairs so {i}nobody{/i} has to turn into a statue tonight!"
    leo "Ibumu menunggumu di dapur yang harum wangi lemon dan jahe, Sera! Dan Vespera menyeret pelat perunggu seberat seratus lima puluh kilo mendaki enam ratus anak tangga agar {i}tak seorang pun{/i} harus berubah menjadi patung malam ini!"

# game/story/chapter4.rpy:125
translate indonesian chapter4_start_01cacfa5:

    # narrator "Seraphina freezes on the very edge of the golden fire. Her lip trembles—and when Vespera lunges forward, Sera grabs her outstretched scarred wrist with both hands and stumbles back onto solid stone!"
    narrator "Seraphina mematung tepat di bibir kobaran api keemasan itu. Bibirnya bergetar—dan ketika Vespera menerjang maju, Sera mencengkeram pergelangan tangan penuh luka Vespera yang terulur dengan kedua tangannya dan terhuyung mundur ke atas batu yang kokoh!"

# game/story/chapter4.rpy:127
translate indonesian chapter4_start_d9d73461:

    # sera "...Lemon. Her name is Mei-Ling. Oh god—her name is Mei-Ling!"
    sera "...Lemon. Namanya Mei-Ling. Ya Tuhan—namanya Mei-Ling!"

# game/story/chapter4.rpy:135
translate indonesian chapter4_start_00e7a4b1:

    # cassian "...First-Era bronze?! Guards—sheathe blades! Help the Rootwarden bolt those leads into the stone!"
    cassian "...Perunggu Era Pertama?! Prajurit—sarungkan bilah! Bantu Penjaga Akar memasang baut kabel-kabel itu ke batu!"

# game/story/chapter4.rpy:136
translate indonesian chapter4_start_0cf4da22:

    # narrator "Bram bodily scoops a stunned Seraphina back from the ledge behind his tower shield as Cassian drops to one knee beside Vespera's wrench!"
    narrator "Bram merengkuh Seraphina yang terpana menjauh dari tepian tebing ke balik perisai menaranya saat Cassian berlutut di samping kunci pas Vespera!"

# game/story/chapter4.rpy:138
translate indonesian chapter4_start_f4817b57:

    # narrator "Bram lunges forward, hooking Seraphina's collar back from the flames just as a shockwave cracks the altar stone in half!"
    narrator "Bram menerjang maju, mencengkeram kerah mantel Seraphina menjauh dari kobaran api tepat saat gelombang kejut membelah batu altar menjadi dua!"

# game/story/chapter4.rpy:144
translate indonesian chapter4_start_02d1e274:

    # vespera "LEO, NO! WHAT ARE YOU DOING?!"
    vespera "LEO, JANGAN! APA YANG KAU LAKUKAN?!"

translate indonesian strings:

    # game/story/chapter4.rpy:74
    old "Pick up the muddy notebook page—shaking hands and all—and refuse to hate the kid who drew it. \"Yeah, it hurt. And I don't need a crown to stand up anymore.\""
    new "Pungut halaman buku catatan berlumpur itu—meski kedua tangan gemetar—dan tolak membenci bocah yang menggambarnya. \"Ya, itu menyakitkan. Dan aku tak butuh mahkota lagi untuk bangkit berdiri.\""

    # game/story/chapter4.rpy:84
    old "Seize the ambient Astral Resonance swirling in the mist and blast the memory to ash! (Costs -18% Tether, +28% Resonance)"
    new "Raih Resonansi Astral liar yang berputar di dalam kabut dan bakar habis ingatan itu hingga jadi abu! (Bayaran -18% Jangkar, +28% Resonansi)"

    # game/story/chapter4.rpy:93
    old "Keep my head down, clutch Orin's copper spade like a lifeline, and push blindly through the mist (-5% Tether, +1 Courage)."
    new "Tundukkan kepala, genggam sekop tembaga Orin seerat mungkin, dan terus terobos kabut dengan membabi buta (-5% Jangkar, +1 Keberanian)."

    # game/story/chapter4.rpy:119
    old "(Remind Her of Home) \"Chicago! Lakeshore buses hissing in November rain—and hot tea with LEMON! Step off that ledge, Sera—we brought the First-Era Plate!\""
    new "(Ingatkan Tentang Rumah) \"Chicago! Desis bus Lakeshore di tengah hujan November—dan teh panas dengan LEMON! Menjauhlah dari tepi jurang itu, Sera—kami membawa Pelat Era Pertama!\""

    # game/story/chapter4.rpy:129
    old "(Rally With Grit) Plant Orin's copper spade right between Sera and the fire! \"Marshal Cassian! Help us bolt this Calibration Plate down—we're grounding the Crucible, not feeding it!\""
    new "(Kobarkan Keteguhan) Tancapkan sekop tembaga Orin tepat di antara Sera dan kobaran api! \"Marsekal Cassian! Bantu kami memasang baut Pelat Kalibrasi ini—kita membumikan Kawah, bukan memberinya tumbal!\""

    # game/story/chapter4.rpy:140
    old "(Temptation of the Crown) Step past Seraphina toward the golden pillar myself. \"Get back, Sera. My longing reading was higher than yours—let me take it.\""
    new "(Godaan Mahkota) Melangkah melewati Seraphina menuju pilar emas itu sendiri. \"Mundur, Sera. Angka kerinduanku lebih tinggi darimu—biarkan aku yang menanggungnya.\""
